WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
What are the benefits for me of participating in the Bounty Mecha Tournament?

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:03,960
There are bounties to be earned

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:07,320
You can increase your actual combat experience to become stronger and continue

4
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:10,000
You can fight side by side with the three strongest people in Kirin in the future.

5
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:11,590
This is to cultivate the relationship between our partners

6
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:13,270
The best way to bond, Huang Si'er

7
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:15,110
If you keep doing this, I'll throw you out.

8
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:18,150
The two of them said that Qilin is the strongest in the first grade.

9
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:19,110
I barely admitted it

10
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,270
Where did you get your confidence?

11
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:22,470
That's because you still don't know the style of our team

12
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:25,110
Don't look at me, I'm only B grade now, but I believe it

13
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:27,030
Will soon reach A-level and S-level

14
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:29,510
Show me the game video first. Yes, yes.

15
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,990
Pull him in quickly

16
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:40,870
weasel

17
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,950
What's the matter? Huang Si'er, don't you like it?

18
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:44,990
Then take a look at which one you like among us.

19
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,110
We can exchange it with you

20
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:47,390
Forget it, forget it

21
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:50,200
Why is it that I am a weasel when I come here?
